1
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:03,560
Wait. ls this really worth it?

2
00:00:03,723 --> 00:00:07,603
(Sheldon:)We've lived together for years
with nary an argument.

3
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,760
(Leonard:)Huh?

4
00:00:08,928 --> 00:00:10,738
(Sheldon:)But we start talking about a table,

5
00:00:10,897 --> 00:00:12,937
(Raj:)and suddenly we're
at each other's throats.

6
00:00:14,667 --> 00:00:16,377
"Nary an argument"?

7
00:00:18,237 --> 00:00:20,217
"Nary"?

8
00:00:21,107 --> 00:00:23,277
That means "not one," or "not any".

9
00:00:24,444 --> 00:00:26,894
(Sheldon:)Maybe instead of a table,
you should buy a dictionary.

10
00:00:30,283 --> 00:00:33,563
(Sheldon:)I don't know if I won that,
but at least he's upset.

11
00:00:35,221 --> 00:00:36,631
(Howard:)Check it out.

12
00:00:39,459 --> 00:00:41,199
Magic wand TV remote!

13
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:43,810
(Howard:)Yeah, I can control
all sorts of stuff.

14
00:00:43,963 --> 00:00:45,373
(Raj:)Did Bernadette think it was cool?

15
00:00:45,531 --> 00:00:48,641
Not when I said "mute"
and pointed it at her face.

16
00:00:48,801 --> 00:00:50,471
(Raj:)Let me try.

17
00:00:52,438 --> 00:00:54,438
Channelis changeroni!

18
00:00:55,742 --> 00:01:04,022
(Raj:)This might be my second
favourite brown magic wand.

